mpaign  staffers that Muller has pulled into  this investigation to question  people who currently work for the  president in the White House every  single day have been called before that  grand jury and Trump doesn't know what  they've said he doesn't know what the  other people have said who don't work  for him anymore he doesn't know what  kind of information to people like gates  and Flynn and Manta fort have handed  over he knows that  five witnesses in the mana fort trial  have been given immunity maybe they  turned something else over there's so  many unknowns right now for this guy  that he is absolutely losing his mind  and because he likes to do so very  publicly on Twitter we all get to see it  happen in real time let's just hope that  whatever the outcome is of this  investigation whether it's impeachment  whether it's you know acquittal whatever  it is let's hope that we get to that  conclusion before Donald Trump does  something drastic like I don't know  maybe starting a new war in the Middle  East that's not out of the realm of  possibility and considering his threat  from Monday it's something we all need  to take very seriously
 

